(2212626, 303696, 46336, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful take. I think it relies a bit too heavily on the title to meet challenge, but still manages. Persoanlly I think the blue border takes away from the impact. Yellow might have been better, or a slightly different blue. I''ll give you an 8 though.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful take. I think it relies a bit too heavily on the title to meet challenge, but still manages. Persoanlly I think the blue border takes away from the impact. Yellow might have been better, or a slightly different blue. I''ll give you an 8 though.', '2006-03-08 20:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2212632, 302533, 46336, '<td valign="top">I expected mroe along these lines... maybe because tis is the direction my own choice went. I like the balance of the shot - good choice of lines. Personally I tend not to like shots with a vague centre bar out of focus. I would love to have seen the top right corner as sharp. Still, nice shot.</td>', 'I expected mroe along these lines... maybe because tis is the direction my own choice went. I like the balance of the shot - good choice of lines. Personally I tend not to like shots with a vague centre bar out of focus. I would love to have seen the top right corner as sharp. Still, nice shot.', '2006-03-08 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
