(2228682, 302565, 23430, '<td valign="top">I knew from the thread that others didn''t get it so I was ready but I still didn''t pick it. Very well done and Ripped Off. Oh well good to see you''re still pumping out great shots.</td>', 'I knew from the thread that others didn''t get it so I was ready but I still didn''t pick it. Very well done and Ripped Off. Oh well good to see you''re still pumping out great shots.', '2006-03-15 00:33:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2228696, 302571, 24017, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this picture didn''t do better, it was my pick for the blue!! Maybe people didn''t "get" the Prestone. Great work and an ingenious idea.</td>', 'I can''t believe this picture didn''t do better, it was my pick for the blue!! Maybe people didn''t "get" the Prestone. Great work and an ingenious idea.', '2006-03-15 00:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2228761, 304179, 51001, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  My 1st ribbon... thanks to everyone of you who voted for me -- it''s a huge encouragement for becoming a better photographer.<br/> <br/>I made a special trip to the Georgia Aquarium (~2 hrs away from me) just for the challenge.  I''d never seen a Leafy Sea Dragon before, but it seemed perfect... I took over 30 pics trying to get one that was "just right".  <br/> <br/>BTW, I had no idea, until the voting started, that this creature had been entered before (*winning a yellow in the ''camouflage'' challenge in November ''05).  And there was another one (but from a different aquarium, I believe) also entered in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow!!  My 1st ribbon... thanks to everyone of you who voted for me -- it''s a huge encouragement for becoming a better photographer. I made a special trip to the Georgia Aquarium (~2 hrs away from me) just for the challenge.  I''d never seen a Leafy Sea Dragon before, but it seemed perfect... I took over 30 pics trying to get one that was "just right".   BTW, I had no idea, until the voting started, that this creature had been entered before (*winning a yellow in the ''camouflage'' challenge in November ''05).  And there was another one (but from a different aquarium, I believe) also entered in this challenge.', '2006-03-15 00:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2228768, 304221, 15711, '<td valign="top">WHat a rip off. This deserved top 20 for sure.</td>', 'WHat a rip off. This deserved top 20 for sure.', '2006-03-15 00:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2228785, 304039, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon...I gave you 8 for this and am glad you got a spot on the podium</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon...I gave you 8 for this and am glad you got a spot on the podium', '2006-03-15 00:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
