(2289290, 304103, 50695, '<td valign="top">I read the thread you made about this picture and it made me see that I underscored it. I thought it was simply the clown makeup that made for the masquerade and gave it an average score, 5, but looking closer I see what you mean: the clown make-up is covering up a very sad demeanor. It''s unfortunate that there are so many challenge entries that it''s difficult to spend enough time with each shot. Shots like this deserve more time than that!</td>', 'I read the thread you made about this picture and it made me see that I underscored it. I thought it was simply the clown makeup that made for the masquerade and gave it an average score, 5, but looking closer I see what you mean: the clown make-up is covering up a very sad demeanor. It''s unfortunate that there are so many challenge entries that it''s difficult to spend enough time with each shot. Shots like this deserve more time than that!', '2006-04-05 11:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
